  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Sayyad Jamir Sayyed Isak vs The State Of Maharashtra on 6 October, 2022 Author: S. G. Mehare Bench: S. G. Mehare 910-Aba-1333-22 (1) In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad Anticipatory Bail Application No.1333 Of 2022 Sayyad Jamir Sayyed Isak Versus The State Of Maharashtra Mr. S. S. Gangakhedkar, Advocate for applicant; Mr. V. M. Kagne, A.P.P. for respondent Coram : S. G. Mehare, J. Date : 6th October, 2022 P.C. 1. Heard the learned counsel for the applicant.",
    "facts": "In any case, Section 328 of the Indian Penal Code would not attract. The said issue has been seized with the Honourable Supreme Court and the persons approached the Honourable Supreme Court have been granted interim protection. The applicant has been implicated in the crime being the uncle of accused No.2 Shaikh Mohsin. That apart, nothing is to be recovered from the applicant.",
